### Accepted examples (post-fix Â§8)

Accepted â€” [`cache_block_size.yaml`](results/run_qwen_fast/cache_block_size.yaml) (previously rejected, now recovered):

```yaml
- name: cache_block_size
  type: numeric_range
  isa_visible: true
  visibility_justification: CBO.ZERO and CBO.CLEAN operate on cache-block-sized granules,
    so the block size affects the address range of each instruction.
```

Accepted â€” [`wlrl_field_behavior.yaml`](results/run_qwen_fast/wlrl_field_behavior.yaml):

```yaml
- name: wlrl_supported_values
  type: field_behavior
  isa_visible: true
  visibility_justification: Software can read back the CSR with CSRRS to see which
    written values stick.
```

