## Claims NOT being made

Full list: [`CLAIM-LEDGER.md`](CLAIM-LEDGER.md).

| Tempting claim | Reality |
|----------------|---------|
| Historical recall = discovery | Only `v8_discovery` is cold naming |
| Multi-model success | **Not claimed** â€” only Qwen post-gate artifacts are committed |
| Upstream UDB contribution | Format samples in [`results/udb/`](results/udb/); `cache_block_size` now accepted post-fix â€” UDB PR viable pending quality review |
| Historical F1 generalizes | Falsified (post-fix 30 F1 = 0.2353; Bâ€“D = 0) |

